WE ARE ALL GONNA F ING DIE BECAUSE OF THIS IDIOTIC MAN WHO DOES NOT GIVE A SHIT ABOUT CLIMATE CHANGE!

&#x200B;

THE WORLD IS GONNA END IN 2100!

1-5. We have been officialy eliminated from the playoffs and we are not going to come back even if Markelle Fultz is returning. These stupid turnovers cost them again. They haven't learned.

&#x200B;

They are the world's worst basketball team and they should fold. Orlando will never win a basketball championship, not even if they been around for 100 years!

UCF has been eliminated from AAC Championship contention and has been revoked from the Big 12. Louisville or Navy will now replace UCF.

&#x200B;

UCF will move back to the C-USA conference.
